{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.meguru.purity",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "纯白",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 2,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.meguru.purity",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.meguru.purity",
    "idolId": "meguru",
    "startNodeId": "1-01",
    "nodes": {
      "1-01": {
        "id": "1-01",
        "text": "其他人好像还没到。巡每次都来这么早吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-02",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-02": {
        "id": "1-02",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "今天是碰巧啦！学校那边的事情结束得早。",
        "nextNodeId": "1-03"
      },
      "1-03": {
        "id": "1-03",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "你看你看，我的身体比之前柔软了吧——！",
        "nextNodeId": "1-04"
      },
      "1-04": {
        "id": "1-04",
        "text": "真的，腿抬得很干净。",
        "nextNodeId": "1-05",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-05": {
        "id": "1-05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖！",
        "nextNodeId": "1-06"
      },
      "1-06": {
        "id": "1-06",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "啊，我想拉伸一下，能帮我压着背吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-07"
      },
      "1-07": {
        "id": "1-07",
        "text": "好。这样？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-08",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-08": {
        "id": "1-08",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯！谢谢——！",
        "nextNodeId": "1-09"
      },
      "1-09": {
        "id": "1-09",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "说起来，制作人谈过恋爱吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-10"
      },
      "1-10": {
        "id": "1-10",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-11",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "1-11": {
        "id": "1-11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "前几天舞蹈课来了外面的老师吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "1-12"
      },
      "1-12": {
        "id": "1-12",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "他说我虽然跳得认真，但感情表现不够。",
        "nextNodeId": "1-13"
      },
      "1-13": {
        "id": "1-13",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "让我回想起恋爱时的心动，把感情放进去……",
        "nextNodeId": "1-14"
      },
      "1-14": {
        "id": "1-14",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "可是，我……根本不知道那种东西啊——！",
        "nextNodeId": "1-15"
      },
      "1-15": {
        "id": "1-15",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "制作人知道吗？恋爱是什么感觉？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "心跳加速的感觉",
            "nextNodeId": "2-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "expression",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "心头一紧的感觉",
            "nextNodeId": "3-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "你可以看看书",
            "nextNodeId": "4-01",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "sharedStat",
                "stat": "stress",
                "delta": -2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "2-01": {
        "id": "2-01",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-02"
      },
      "2-02": {
        "id": "2-02",
        "text": "巡没有心跳加速过吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-03",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-03": {
        "id": "2-03",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "有啊。站在舞台上的时候！",
        "nextNodeId": "2-04"
      },
      "2-04": {
        "id": "2-04",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "在后台，真乃和灯织就在旁边，等出场的那一刻最……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-05"
      },
      "2-05": {
        "id": "2-05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "明明特别兴奋，可有时候心还是会揪一下……",
        "nextNodeId": "2-06"
      },
      "2-06": {
        "id": "2-06",
        "text": "那就用那时候的心情去跳，怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-07": {
        "id": "2-07",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "那样也可以？就算不是恋爱？",
        "nextNodeId": "2-08"
      },
      "2-08": {
        "id": "2-08",
        "text": "老师想说的，大概是像恋爱那样强烈的心意吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-09",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-09": {
        "id": "2-09",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "是吗……！",
        "nextNodeId": "2-10"
      },
      "2-10": {
        "id": "2-10",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "我还在想，要是必须马上去谈恋爱可怎么办。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-11"
      },
      "2-11": {
        "id": "2-11",
        "text": "哈哈，不用勉强。",
        "nextNodeId": "2-12",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "2-12": {
        "id": "2-12",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯嗯，一定是这样！",
        "nextNodeId": "2-13"
      },
      "2-13": {
        "id": "2-13",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "好，我现在就来试试看……！"
      },
      "3-01": {
        "id": "3-01",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嘿……恋爱是件好事啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-02"
      },
      "3-02": {
        "id": "3-02",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "学校的朋友聊恋爱话题的时候，看起来确实很开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-03"
      },
      "3-03": {
        "id": "3-03",
        "text": "巡也想谈一次吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "3-04": {
        "id": "3-04",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯——……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-05"
      },
      "3-05": {
        "id": "3-05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "……我最喜欢大家了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-06"
      },
      "3-06": {
        "id": "3-06",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "可是，喜欢到什么程度才算恋爱呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-07"
      },
      "3-07": {
        "id": "3-07",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "是在我的\"最喜欢\"更前面，还是完全在别的地方呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-08"
      },
      "3-08": {
        "id": "3-08",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "就是不知道这个，才连想不想谈都不清楚……诶嘿嘿。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-09"
      },
      "3-09": {
        "id": "3-09",
        "text": "按你的步调来就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-10",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "3-10": {
        "id": "3-10",
        "text": "跳舞的时候，试着想一想你最喜欢的那些人正看着你。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-11",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "3-11": {
        "id": "3-11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "哇，好像很有趣……！",
        "nextNodeId": "3-12"
      },
      "3-12": {
        "id": "3-12",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "把心意传达给最喜欢的大家的那种感觉……嗯……嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "3-13"
      },
      "3-13": {
        "id": "3-13",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "可以现在试一下吗！？我去放音乐……！",
        "nextNodeId": "3-14"
      },
      "3-14": {
        "id": "3-14",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "……啊，可是。",
        "nextNodeId": "3-15"
      },
      "3-15": {
        "id": "3-15",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "如果有一天我对谁心跳了一下，",
        "nextNodeId": "3-16"
      },
      "3-16": {
        "id": "3-16",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "那到时候要好好向制作人报告才行！"
      },
      "4-01": {
        "id": "4-01",
        "text": "这不是别人教你就能懂的。要不要试着代入书或者电影里的主角？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-02": {
        "id": "4-02",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-03"
      },
      "4-03": {
        "id": "4-03",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "果然还是，知道真正的恋爱会比较好吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-04"
      },
      "4-04": {
        "id": "4-04",
        "text": "……巡很喜欢跳舞吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-05",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-05": {
        "id": "4-05",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "嗯！我想跳得更好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4-06"
      },
      "4-06": {
        "id": "4-06",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "最开始只是觉得开心而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-07"
      },
      "4-07": {
        "id": "4-07",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "但成了偶像之后见到很多粉丝……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-08"
      },
      "4-08": {
        "id": "4-08",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "现在，我想让看我表演的大家也觉得开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-09"
      },
      "4-09": {
        "id": "4-09",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "所以，我能做的我都想努力做到……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4-10"
      },
      "4-10": {
        "id": "4-10",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-11",
        "speakerId": "meguru"
      },
      "4-11": {
        "id": "4-11",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿。不过我知道，恋爱不是想做到就能做到的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-12"
      },
      "4-12": {
        "id": "4-12",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "我去看看书！虽然要理解主角的心情可能还要很久……",
        "nextNodeId": "4-13"
      },
      "4-13": {
        "id": "4-13",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-14"
      },
      "4-14": {
        "id": "4-14",
        "text": "怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-15",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-15": {
        "id": "4-15",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "……制作人！我想跳一下，你帮我看看！",
        "nextNodeId": "4-16"
      },
      "4-16": {
        "id": "4-16",
        "text": "你明白什么了吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4-17",
        "speakerId": "producer"
      },
      "4-17": {
        "id": "4-17",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "我想让制作人记住现在的我！这样哪天我变了，你随时都能发现。",
        "nextNodeId": "4-18"
      },
      "4-18": {
        "id": "4-18",
        "speakerId": "meguru",
        "text": "对吧，是个好主意吧！？我去放音乐！"
      }
    }
  },
